[
  {
    "id": "anno-matsuoka_upper_p217_left-00",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "（此米八十三石三斗二升七合九勺三才 石八兩立）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "（此の米 八十三石三斗二升七合九勺三才、石につき八両立）／このこめ はちじゅうさんこく さんど にしょう ななごう きゅうしゃく さんさい、こくにつき はちりょうだて"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "(Equivalent in rice: 83.32793 koku, reckoned at 8 ryō per koku.) This converts the cash portion of the regular land tax (正税) whose figure prints as the last column of the facing leaf, 永六百六拾六貫六百貳拾三文五分 = 666.6235 ryō; 666.6235 divided by 8 gives 83.3279375 koku, truncated at the 才 place to the printed 83.32793, and the small note 石八兩立 states that rate. Read before the 雜税 label because it stands to its right."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "正税此米"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p217_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:2686,1388,104,1647"
      }
    }
  },
  {
