    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "雜税 稗百三拾三石八斗壹升五合（兩五斗替）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "雑税 稗 百三十三石八斗一升五合（両五斗替）／ざつぜい ひえ ひゃくさんじゅうさんこく はっと いっしょう ごごう（りょう ごとがえ）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Miscellaneous taxes (zatsuzei). First component: barnyard millet (hie), 133.815 koku, valued at the rate of 5 to (0.5 koku) to the ryō. MASTER's raw string for this row (一萬三千四百四拾石四斗壹升五合貳勺三才) is not what the page prints; the scan reads 稗百三拾三石八斗壹升五合, and MASTER's parsed 133.815 is correct."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "雜税"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p217_left.jpg",
